VALIDATION 2 -- the tidal matrix is TRACELESS: vacuum, so pure Weyl
  static, at closest approach: |trace| / |max component|          0.000162286              0  ok
       h-independent at 1.6e-4 over an order of magnitude in step size,
       so this residue is the metric's own O(Phi^2), not the difference.
